:{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nWin 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I add a collision shape to a CollisionShape3D in my scene opene as an editable child the shape can't be edited until the scene is saved, closed, and re-opened, or unless the shape is marked as unique.\n\nBefore:\n\n<img width=\"577\" height=\"378\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67588ac0-999a-48f1-995a-75f1c883d18e\" />\n\nAfter:\n\n<img width=\"480\" height=\"272\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aaa6a201-86a5-4fd1-b3d5-8a62edcb342b\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP.\n2. Add BoxShape3D to the CollisionShape3D.\n3. Try to change the size. (shouldn't be possible)\n4. Save the scene with the box shape and close it.\n5. Open the scene again.\n6. Try to change the size. (it should work)\n7. (Instead of reopening the scene you can also try to switch to another scene tab and that back - though I think it sometimes doesn't make it work unlike the re-opening?)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[EditableChildrenCollider.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23241323/EditableChildrenCollider.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112211/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112211/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}